  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ph 403.10 Reinstatement. Any pharmacist desiring reinstatement of licensure shall show evidence of completion of at least 1.5 CEU's, according to Ph 403.02(d) and earned in the 12 months immediately preceding the date of application for reinstatement.\n\nSource. #4600, eff 8-1-89; ss by #6094-B, INTERIM, eff 9-21-95, EXPIRED, 1-19-96\n\nNew. #6181-B, eff 2-5-96, EXPIRED: 2-5-04\n\nNew. #8316, eff 3-26-05, EXPIRED: 3-26-13\n\nNew. #10812, eff 4-18-15",
